{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_08FF20","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"绝不能输给苏联的“Vostok”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"NASA决定大幅省略测试流程，把飞行日程提前。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"他们把日程压到了极限，发射定在第二天凌晨。对<R=NASA的发射场,CAPE CANAVERAL>来说，这将是一次午夜发射。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=NASA的发射场,CAPE CANAVERAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":140,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"飞行路线选择了向东移动距离最长的方案，好让她至少能从“窗户”看到一点地球的白昼部分。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"The Boss也省略了两成以上的登舱程序，直接进入<R=宇宙船,MERCURY>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=宇宙船,MERCURY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"无论发射时间还是航线都很危险，测试也不充分。可是NASA已经别无选择。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"就连The Boss自己，也没想过还能回到地球。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这是一趟无法归来的旅程。她受到的待遇，和那只莱卡犬没有两样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"即便如此，她还是登上了<R=　船　,MERCURY>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=　船　,MERCURY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"她说：“总要有人成为第一个。如果命运选择了我，那我就接受。为了祖国，也为了世界的平衡。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"The Boss就是这么说的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":29,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"“只要还有哪怕一丝可能，我就愿意赌上去。只有接受命运的人，才有资格超越命运。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"于是，4月12日凌晨1点30分，The Boss升上了太空。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"那简直是奇迹。一是她竟能乘着临时赶制的飞船进入太空；二是这次<R=飞行,FLIGHT>竟几乎与加加林同时进行……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=飞行,FLIGHT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":149,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"她从那里看到了地球。伴随着日出，她也被从窗户射入的宇宙射线侵蚀着……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"我想，她应该已经把那时的事告诉过你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"没有国界的地球。无可替代的大地。身处太空，国家与意识形态都显得无比遥远。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"她说，想到此前还在和苏联争分夺秒，就觉得这一切荒唐得可笑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"她还说：“如果能从窗户看到Vostok，我一定会向它挥手吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"可是，两艘飞船此后的命运却截然不同。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"苏联的加加林绕地球一周后，平安着陆。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"而The Boss的飞船，却在重返大气层时偏离了正确角度。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"看来，是强行加装的窗户制造了异常涡流。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"她乘坐的飞船严重偏离轨道，开始向地面坠落……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""}]}